      "about": {
        "title": "Room for the whole family",
        "lede": "The 572 stretches the Pure Cube to a full 76½\" of bench, so three or four people can sit back without bumping elbows.",
        "items": [
          [
            "Long, two-tier benches",
            "A 34\" upper bench for the most heat and a 17\" lower bench for an easier session, both a full 76½\" long in clear red cedar."
          ],
          [
            "A wall of glass",
            "Three 25¾\" panels across the front, with the glass door in the middle. Swap to mirrored glass or slatted semi-privacy panels if neighbours are close."
          ],
          [
            "Canadian red cedar",
            "Western red cedar inside and out handles heat and moisture, resists rot and stays comfortable to touch. Knotty is rustic; clear is smooth and knot-free."
          ],
          [
            "Built for four seasons",
            "An EPDM roof, tempered glass and raised base skids keep it dry and working through Ontario snow, freeze and thaw."
          ]
        ]
